  <data key="d0">Acknowledgment of Contributions to Transformer Model (discarded)</data>
  <data key="d1">discarded</data>
  <data key="d2">This content acknowledges the contributions of various authors to the development of the Transformer model, detailing their specific roles and collaborative efforts. It highlights the importance of teamwork in achieving advancements in neural network architectures, particularly in the context of the paper's focus on the Transformer.</data>
