<node id="Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image illustrates the architecture of the Transformer model, highlighting the encoder-decoder structure and the flow of data through multi-head attention mechanisms. It serves as a visual reference for the accompanying text discussing the advantages of the Transformer over traditional recurrent neural networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4ac1cb78dc67aff8ce4087987f1a2d2</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763839326</data>
</node>
