<node id="Comparison of Machine Translation Models (table)">
  <data key="d0">Comparison of Machine Translation Models (table)</data>
  <data key="d1">table</data>
  <data key="d2">This table compares BLEU scores and training costs of various machine translation models, highlighting the superior performance of the Transformer (big) model over previous state-of-the-art models, thus illustrating the effectiveness and efficiency of the Transformer architecture in translation tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ed07f99f8445bb668180c9784140e27</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763839326</data>
</node>
